    title: "Grover\'s Music Maker",
    developer: Some("Stephan Keith, Catherine Keith, Laura Scholl"),
    description: Some("An unreleased Sesame Street music toy for young children. You pick letters to set Grover dancing to one of eighteen built-in tunes — each of his ten dance moves tied to a musical note — or switch to a record mode and punch in a sequence of up to fifty notes and moves for him to play back, composing a little song or a silly dance of your own."),
